<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1682208287"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:51.587"><div begin="12.574" end="38.340" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.574" end="18.433" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.574" end="13.698">岁月在默数</span><span begin="13.698" end="14.380">三四五</span><span begin="14.380" end="15.187">六</span> <span begin="16.360" end="16.639">第</span><span begin="16.639" end="17.031">六</span><span begin="17.031" end="17.580">天以</span><span begin="17.580" end="18.433">后</span></p><p begin="19.532" end="24.558" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.532" end="20.358">⼈们开始</span><span begin="20.358" end="20.984">存在宇</span><span begin="20.984" end="22.044">宙</span> <span begin="22.644" end="23.283">黑夜和</span><span begin="23.283" end="23.558">白</span><span begin="23.558" end="24.558">昼</span></p><p begin="27.022" end="31.865" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.022" end="27.844">呼吸第⼀</span><span begin="27.844" end="28.676">口气的咽</span><span begin="28.676" end="29.457">喉</span> <span begin="29.727" end="30.367">最怕命</span><span begin="30.367" end="31.031">运小</span><span begin="31.031" end="31.865">偷</span></p><p begin="32.862" end="38.340" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.862" end="33.775">坏和美好</span> <span begin="33.775" end="34.454">我用血</span><span begin="34.454" end="35.573">肉</span><span begin="36.049" end="36.625">去</span><span begin="36.625" end="36.849">感</span><span begin="36.849" end="38.340">受</span></p></div><div begin="39.292" end="1:13.390" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="39.292" end="45.256" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.292" end="40.348">问宿命是否</span> <span begin="40.348" end="40.992">再多久</span> <span begin="40.992" end="41.396">再</span><span begin="41.396" end="41.897">持久</span> <span begin="41.897" end="42.269">再</span><span begin="42.269" end="42.735">永久</span> <span begin="42.735" end="43.161">抵</span><span begin="43.161" end="43.607">不了</span><span begin="43.607" end="44.108">不</span><span begin="44.108" end="45.256">朽</span></p><p begin="45.985" end="51.846" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.985" end="47.010">恋人从挥手</span> <span begin="47.010" end="47.643">到牵手</span> <span begin="47.643" end="48.046">到</span><span begin="48.046" end="48.455">放手</span> <span begin="48.455" end="48.886">到</span><span begin="48.886" end="49.317">挥手</span> <span begin="49.317" end="49.755">就</span><span begin="49.755" end="50.248">该足</span><span begin="50.248" end="51.846">够</span></p><p begin="52.647" end="56.705" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.647" end="53.664">对夜的长吼</span> <span begin="53.664" end="54.204">我胸口</span><span begin="54.204" end="54.614">的</span><span begin="54.614" end="55.080">伤口</span> <span begin="55.080" end="55.518">随</span><span begin="55.518" end="55.994">风陈</span><span begin="55.994" end="56.705">旧</span></p><p begin="57.074" end="1:01.165" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.074" end="57.646">你我</span><span begin="57.646" end="58.234">终</span><span begin="58.234" end="58.557">会</span><span begin="58.557" end="59.110">沦</span><span begin="59.110" end="59.330">为</span><span begin="59.330" end="59.892">尘</span><span begin="59.892" end="1:00.122">埃</span><span begin="1:00.122" end="1:00.605">漂</span><span begin="1:00.605" end="1:01.165">流</span></p><p begin="1:01.436" end="1:07.750" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.436" end="1:01.867">等待</span><span begin="1:01.867" end="1:02.404">花</span><span begin="1:02.404" end="1:03.333">季烟</span><span begin="1:03.333" end="1:03.627">雨</span><span begin="1:03.627" end="1:04.535">稠</span> <span begin="1:04.857" end="1:05.136">再</span><span begin="1:05.136" end="1:05.737">化</span><span begin="1:05.737" end="1:06.023">降</span><span begin="1:06.023" end="1:06.581">水</span><span begin="1:06.581" end="1:06.861">驻</span><span begin="1:06.861" end="1:07.750">守</span></p><p begin="1:08.045" end="1:13.390" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="